   "part": 1,
   "pin": null,
   "question": "Whether throwing immediately in FindTx prevents callers from trying fallback lookups (such as UTXO set lookup in ProcessPSBT) that might succeed",
   "quote": "I wonder if throwing immediately here could prevent callers from trying other lookups that might still succeed for example in `ProcessPSBT`",
   "request": "",
   "status": "accepted",
   "status_by": {
    "at": "2026-10-14",
    "by": "enirox001",
    "id": "c:6171297356",
    "quote": "Sounds good, letting the user know early on that the index is corrupted is a good idea"
   },
   "status_note": "maflcko clarified it is intentional to notify about index corruption early, and enirox001 agreed",
   "type": "question",
